## Usage

### Pagination
Navigate through pages of data. Change items per page with `TxSelect`; `TxPagination` recalculates the page count and clamps the current page when needed.
:::TuffDemoWrapper{demo="PaginationPaginationDemo" code-lang="vue"}
---
code: |
  <script setup lang="ts">
  import { ref } from 'vue'

  const page = ref(1)
  const pageSize = ref(10)
  </script>

  <template>
    <TxPagination
      v-model:current-page="page"
      :total="120"
      :page-size="pageSize"
      show-info
      show-first-last
    />
    <TxSelect v-model="pageSize" aria-label="Items per page">
      <TxSelectItem v-for="size in [10, 20, 50]" :key="size" :value="size" :label="String(size)" />
    </TxSelect>
  </template>
---
:::

### Best Practices

- Prefer `total + pageSize` so the UI can reflect item counts; use `totalPages` only when the backend cannot return totals.
- Keep `currentPage` one-based. Initialize the model to `1`, not `0`.
- Reset `currentPage` to `1` when filters or search terms change and the old page may be out of range.
- Keep pagination adjacent to the list or table it controls.
- Use the `info` slot for localized range copy such as “Viewing 21–40 of 120 items”.

## API Reference

### Props
::TuffPropsTable
---
rows:
  - name: currentPage
    type: number
    default: '1'
    description: Current page
  - name: pageSize
    type: number
    default: '10'
    description: Items per page
  - name: total
    type: number
    default: '-'
    description: Total item count; when omitted or 0, page count falls back to totalPages
  - name: totalPages
    type: number
    default: '-'
    description: Explicit total page count; used when total is not provided
  - name: prevIcon
    type: string
    default: "''"
    description: Custom previous icon class consumed by TxIcon; empty uses the bundled SVG chevron
  - name: nextIcon
    type: string
    default: "''"
    description: Custom next icon class consumed by TxIcon; empty uses the bundled SVG chevron
  - name: showInfo
    type: boolean
    default: 'false'
    description: Show total info
  - name: showFirstLast
    type: boolean
    default: 'false'
    description: Show first/last buttons
---
::

